## GraphQL Request Format
APA expects an array of operations.

Example request payload:

```json
[
  {
    "operationName": "ViewerQuery",
    "variables": {},
    "query": "query ViewerQuery { viewer { id __typename } }"
  }
]
```

Copilot should always generate this format, even for one operation.

---

## GraphQL Types

### `GraphQlRequest.cs`
```csharp
public sealed class GraphQlRequest
{
    public string OperationName { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Query { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public object? Variables { get; set; }
}
```

### `GraphQlResponse.cs`
```csharp
public sealed class GraphQlResponse<T>
{
    public T? Data { get; set; }
    public GraphQlError[] Errors { get; set; } = [];
}
```

### `GraphQlError.cs`
```csharp
public sealed class GraphQlError
{
    public string Message { get; set; } = string.Empty;
}
```

